90/extras/f3a7cdd68e9c46fcbdf4d1b85d3da762.mp4?t=1753755208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interesting money-making mini-game</h2>\u2014\u2014Make your game story full of fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756390/extras/746b8861aea242425202036dfc2f6445.poster.avif?t=1753755208\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756390/extras/746b8861aea242425202036dfc2f6445.webm?t=1753755208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756390/extras/746b8861aea242425202036dfc2f6445.mp4?t=1753755208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A complete plot story</h2>\u2014\u2014What happened to this robbery?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756390/extras/ebf7005d09526625b40eacb165028e2a.poster.avif?t=1753755208\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756390/extras/ebf7005d09526625b40eacb165028e2a.webm?t=1753755208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756390/extras/ebf7005d09526625b40eacb165028e2a.mp4?t=1753755208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Large map with independent choices</h2>\u2014\u2014Multiple different endings, free choice, what kind of life you want is all in your hands!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756390/extras/a33d0e46ba170bec36a30ba25a0136d4.poster.avif?t=1753755208\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.